    "title": "Frustration grows surrounding road conditions in Horry Co. neighborhood - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By ABC 15 Weather Authority Blog ,\n6 hours ago HORRY COUNTY, S.C. (WPDE) — Residents are expressing frustration over the condition of Sunnehanna Drive, which they claim poses a significant safety hazard. This road, which serves as the main thoroughfare for the Island Green area, is plagued with deep potholes. It's the only access point for several communities, including homes, apartment complexes and vacation rentals. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 6",
